8679 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Wishing to be of the greatest benefit to virtuous people\204especially those devoted to the art of writing\204I have always sought their good\054 sparing no effort to share not only my words but also the results of my work\054 offering them to the judgment of anyone who may assess them as they see fit\056 First\054 I published my initial book of writing samples\054 presenting different letter styles\056 Then came a second book\054 dedicated to refined script for scribes\054 also containing various writing forms\056 Now I have decided to publish yet another specimen\204an example of refined chancery script focused on secretarial writing\054 to satisfy those who prefer this particular style\054 as it is the most widely used and is marked by the dignity and mastery long associated with this profession\056                             1579)
